<p>Serous Otitis Media</p>","<p>If the AME can determine the condition has resolved without sequelae or no symptoms or current problems that would interfere with flight duties</p>
<p>AND</p>
<p>The individual can pass any of the acceptable hearing tests:</p>","<p><strong>ISSUE</strong></p>
<p><strong>Annotate </strong>this information in Block 60</p>"
