<p>OR a <a href=""https://www.faa.gov/ame_guide/media/PilotInformation_DetailedClinicalProgressNote.pdf"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">current, detailed Clinical Progress Note</a> generated from a clinic visit with their treating <strong>ophthalmologist or optometrist</strong> no more than 90 days before the AME exam which addresses all items on the Status Summary.</p>
