<p>For more information see <a href=""https://www.faa.gov/pilots/safety/pilotsafetybrochures/Pilot_Vision_brochure_english.pdf"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">Pilot Vision</a></p>","<p>If the AME can determine the condition is under control and vision meets standards with no symptoms that would interfere with flight or safety-related duties such as:</p>
<ul><li>Glare</li><li>Halos</li><li>Loss of contrast sensitivity</li><li>Poor night vision</li></ul>","<p><strong>ISSUE </strong></p>
