chorioretinitis,CHORIORETINITIS,A. - 5 or more years ago and No treatment needed in past 5 years - Single episode - Completely resolved - Meets all visual acuity (VA) specifications,"The AME should review the following: Chorioretinitis Status Summary or a current, Detailed Clinical Progress Note from the treating ophthalmologist which verifies all questions on the status summary. If this documentation verifies: Single episode, 5 or more years ago, without visual field loss, is unlikely to recur and meets VA requirements:",ISSUE Explain this information in Item 60. Submit a copy of the Chorioretinitis Status Summary and any progress notes or testing for retention in the file.,"<p><strong>A. </strong></p>
