<p>Chorioretinitis Status Summary</p>
<p>or</p>
<p>a <a href=""https://www.faa.gov/ame_guide/media/PilotInformation_DetailedClinicalProgressNote.pdf"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">current, Detailed Clinical Progress Note</a> from the treating <strong>ophthalmologist</strong> which verifies all questions on the status summary.</p>
