<ul><li><strong>7. </strong>Visual field testing (30-2) performed no more than 90 days prior to the AME exam.</li></ul>
<ul><li><strong>8. </strong>Copies of any testing already performed such as electroretinogram (ERG) and optical coherence tomography (OCT).</li></ul>","<p><strong>DEFER </strong></p>
