<p>Submit the following to the FAA for retention in the file:</p>
<p>1. Procedure note detailing the replacement</p>
<p>2. <a href=""https://www.faa.gov/ame_guide/media/Pacemaker_Status_Summary.pdf"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">Pacemaker Status Summary</a></p>
