congenital-heart-conditions,CONGENITAL HEART CONDITIONS,"A. Patent Foramen Ovale (PFO) which is: • Not surgically corrected, • Uncomplicated, • Asymptomatic. This may be identified as a finding on an imaging study such as echo.",If the AME can determine the individual has no symptoms or current problems that would interfere with flight duties and no treatment is recommended:,"ISSUE Discuss the history and if any current symptoms in Item 60 If any concerns, go to row B.","<p><strong>A. </strong>Patent Foramen Ovale (PFO) which is:</p>
