<ul><li><strong>2. It must specifically include</strong>: Indication for transplant, any sequelae prior to transplant, if alcohol was a contributing factor (abuse or dependence), status of the transplant, functional capacity, modifiable risk factors, and prognosis for incapacitation.</li><li><strong>3. </strong>Any recent or expected change in treatment plan.</li><li><strong>4. </strong>Complication history such as:<ul><li>Rejection or graft versus host disease/GVHD;</li><li>Infection Hepatitis C (HCV) or CMV; and/or</li></ul></li></ul>","<p><strong>DEFER </strong></p>
<p>Submit the information to the FAA for a possible Special Issuance</p>
