<p>Item 60.</p>
<ul><li><ul><li>Malignancy due to hepatocellular carcinoma (HCC) or following transplant and initiation of immune-suppressants.</li></ul></li><li><strong>5. Lab:</strong> Complete blood count <strong>(CBC), CMP </strong>with <strong>LFTs </strong>performed <strong>within the past 90 days</strong>.</li><li><strong>6. Imaging:</strong> Copies of the initial and most recent MRI, CT, or PET scan with clinical interpretation.</li><li><strong>7. Specific testing: </strong>Results of<strong> liver biopsy </strong>(already performed).</li><li><strong>8. Hospital records: </strong>History and Physical (H&amp;P), operative notes, and discharge summary.</li><li><strong>9. </strong>Pre-transplant treatment notes that identify the diagnosis/underlying condition which required transplant.</li></ul>"
