<p><strong>Note:</strong> If <strong>2 or more seizures in a lifetime</strong>, from any cause, go to the <strong>Epilepsy section.</strong></p>","<p>After a <strong>four (4)-year recovery period and the last two (2) years must be without anticonvulsant medication, </strong>submit the following for FAA review:</p>
<ul><li>All information in Row B.</li></ul>
<p>Upon review, additional information may be required.</p>","<p><strong>DEFER</strong></p>
