acute-lymphocytic-leukemia-all,ACUTE LYMPHOCYTIC LEUKEMIA (ALL),A. Treatment completed ten (10) or more years ago,"The AME must review an oncology evaluation performed within the previous 12 months. If the oncology evaluation verifies the individual is cured, with no follow up treatment required:",ISSUE Summarize this history in Block 60 and submit the evaluation to the FAA for retention in the pilot’s file.,<p><strong>A. </strong>Treatment completed <strong>ten (10) or more years ago</strong></p>,"<p>The AME must review an oncology evaluation performed within the previous 12 months.</p>
