hypothyroid-or-hypothyroidism,HYPOTHYROID or HYPOTHYROIDISM,B. Primary Hypothyroidism,"See the CACI - Hypothyroidism Worksheet . This will require a current, detailed Clinical Progress Note generated from a clinic visit with the treating physician no more than 90 days before the AME exam AND TSH. Note: As of 1/25/2023, TSH up to 9.9 can be considered for CACI if other criteria are met.","If the pilot meets all CACI worksheet criteria and is otherwise qualified, ISSUE with no time limitation Annotate the correct CACI statement in Block 60 and keep the required supporting information on file.",<p><strong>B. Primary Hypothyroidism</strong></p>,"<p>See the <a href=""https://www.faa.gov/ame_guide/media/C-CACIHypothyroidism.pdf"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">CACI - Hypothyroidism Worksheet</a> . This will require a <strong>current, detailed Clinical Progress Note</strong> generated from a clinic visit with the treating physician <strong>no more than 90 days before</strong> the AME exam AND TSH.</p>
